  id: eduard_van_beinum
  category: bandas musicales
  difficulty: 1
  answer: Eduard van Beinum
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Eduard van Beinum
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABVariations And Fugue On A Theme By Wolfgang
    Amadeus Mozart, Op.132: Variation VI\xBB, de 1943, y llega hasta 1956."
  - "\xABLa Damnation de Faust, Op.24 - Part 1: 3. Marche hongroise\xBB presenta
    una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso cercano a 106 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABPiano Concerto No.1 in D minor, Op.15: 3.
    Rondo (Allegro non troppo)\xBB y \xABSymphonie fantastique, Op.14: 1. R\xEAveries.
    Passions (Largo - Allegro agitato ed appassionato assai)\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABConcerto for Clarinet and Orchestra in A Major, K.622:
    2. Adagio\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABSuite No.3 in D, BWV 1068: 2. Air\xBB
    y \xABConcerto for Flute, Harp, and Orchestra in C, K.299: 2. Andantino\xBB."
